  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cub 102.01 How to Contact the Board. Anyone wishing to contact the current use board shall direct their request in writing to:\n\nCurrent Use Board Clerk\n\nc/o New Hampshire Department of Revenue Administration\n\nPO Box 487\n\nConcord, New Hampshire 03302-0487\n\nSource. #5343, eff 3-05-92; ss by #6694, eff 2-24-98; ss by #12857-A eff 8-23-19",
